The best week in the last 52 was the week starting 2026-01-29 ($476k), and the worst was the week starting 2026-08-06 ($41.7k). The week starting 2026-10-29 ($269k) was the highest since February 2026. Curve's own October recap reports "$551K over October's five weekly payouts". That counts by payout date (weeks starting Sep 24 – Oct 22) and matches the on-chain sum of $551,030 exactly [8].

#### Valuation context (derived, not a forecast)

- Market cap $401.1M ÷ 52-week veCRV payouts $6.80M ≈ 59x. On FDV ($615.5M), about 91x (CoinGecko, 15:43 UTC).

- veCRV cash yield on locked value: $6.80M ÷ (841.9M CRV × $0.2529 = $212.9M) ≈ 3.2% a year, trailing. Curve's reported weekly APR swings from 1.9% to 6.6% [6].

- Emissions value about $24.6M/yr (97.16M × $0.2529), about 3.6x payouts to holders. Curve still pays for liquidity with inflation.

#### Stated plans to increase or redirect revenue

- Swiss Stake's mid-term review (Mar–Apr 2026) and H1 2026 report (Aug 2026) state a plan to propose raising the DAO treasury's share of protocol fees from 10% to 30%. They also propose a legal restructuring into a Swiss Association model and assess four revenue-generating initiatives [7][14]. As of 2026-11-10 no such on-chain vote was found among the latest 300 DAO votes, and the FeeAllocator still reads 10% on-chain. If it passes, the veCRV share falls from 90% to 70%. The treasury gains funding for development, which reduces future CRV grant dilution.

- Llamalend V2 admin fees of 10%, and the option to share borrower cost with issuers/curators [7].

- A 2025 forum counter-proposal asked Yield Basis to send 20% of its revenue to Curve. No such on-chain arrangement was found; what flows to Curve from YB is crvUSD demand (credit line) and LP volume in crvUSD pools [14].

### How to verify on-chain

All commands use public endpoints. Set RPC=https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com. For Etherscan V2, replace YOUR_ETHERSCAN_KEY with your own key (never paste a real key into documents). Results are hex; divide by 1e18.

#### 1. CRV supply and emission rate

# totalSupply() -> 2,433,243,731 CRV at block 26,385,135curl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0xD533a949740bb3306d119CC777fa900bA034cd52","data":"0x18160ddd"},"latest"]}'# rate() -> 3.080982847903985532 CRV/s  (x 31,536,000 = 97,161,875 CRV/yr)curl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0xD533a949740bb3306d119CC777fa900bA034cd52","data":"0x2c4e722e"},"latest"]}'

#### 2. veCRV: locked CRV and voting power

# VotingEscrow.supply() -> 841,901,643 CRV lockedcurl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0x5f3b5DfEb7B28CDbD7FAba78963EE202a494e2A2","data":"0x047fc9aa"},"latest"]}'# VotingEscrow.totalSupply() -> 773,140,890 veCRVcurl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0x5f3b5DfEb7B28CDbD7FAba78963EE202a494e2A2","data":"0x18160ddd"},"latest"]}'# balanceOf(Convex VoterProxy) -> 420,863,439 veCRVcurl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0x5f3b5DfEb7B28CDbD7FAba78963EE202a494e2A2","data":"0x70a08231000000000000000000000000989AEb4d175e16225E39E87d0D97A3360524AD80"},"latest"]}'

#### 3. Weekly fees paid to veCRV (the key number)

# FeeDistributor.tokens_per_week(week_start). Week start = Thursday 00:00 UTC, e.g. 2026-10-29 = 1793232000 = 0x6ae28c80# -> 269,092.06 crvUSDcurl -s $RPC -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0xD16d5eC345Dd86Fb63C6a9C43c517210F1027914","data":"0xedf59997000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000006ae28c80"},"latest"]}'# Loop the timestamp back in 604800-second steps to build 4/13/52-week sums# (on 2026-11-10: 4w $614,990; 13w $1,507,971; 52w $6,803,535).# time_cursor() (0x127dcbd3) shows the next un-checkpointed week; token_last_balance() (0x22b04bfc) = crvUSD not yet assigned (71,942.54 on 2026-11-10).# Cross-check with Curve's own API (USD, labelled by week END):curl -s "https://prices.curve.finance/v1/dao/fees/distributions?page=1&per_page=10"

