### Revenue and value capture

#### How 0x Labs makes money (stated mechanism)

- Swap fee: on the Standard plan, 0x charges 0.15% on swaps involving select token pairs (Swap API), 0.15% on Cross-Chain API transactions, and 0.15% plus gas on Gasless API. Fees are taken on-chain inside the swap transaction and reported in the API response (the fees.zeroExFee object). Enterprise plans get volume-based discounts or custom pricing [3][4].

- Subscriptions: the pricing page lists Standard at $1,000 and Enterprise at $2,500 (monthly/yearly toggle, 20% yearly discount) [3].

- Matcha: a 0.05%–0.25% fee on certain pairs for Matcha Auto trades (DefiLlama methodology) [6].

- Solana: zero swap fees during the introductory open beta [14].

- Recipient: 0x Labs-controlled addresses. None of it is routed to ZRX, ZrxTreasury or stakers.

