### Revenue and value capture

Fee flow: users pay maker/taker fees on Premium and Plus accounts, 1 bp on advanced orders and RFQ, and transfer and withdrawal fees. These go to the fee collector (account 281474976496476) and then to the treasury (account 0). Liquidation fees (up to 1% of notional) go to the LLP and are not protocol revenue [5][14]. Treasury account 0 buys LIT with daily 24h TWAP orders on market 2049 (LIT/USDC) and holds it until quarter end; then an equal amount of reserve LIT is burned on Ethereum and the repurchased LIT is withdrawn to 0x1a51…160d and recycled (see "How it works") [1].

