The author's result over all 68 V3 Ethereum Core aTokens, blocks 26,170,481–26,385,281 (about 30 days):

| Source | Total | Of which |

| --- | --- | --- |

| On-chain mints, 30 days | $4.05M | WETH 763.6 ($1.59M), USDT $1.00M, USDC $0.92M, GHO $0.38M, DAI $0.12M. The fact-checker re-ran the four largest (aEthWETH 324 mints = 763.55 WETH; aEthUSDT 231 mints = 1,000,876; aEthUSDC 320 mints = 924,524; aEthGHO 25 mints = 385,548) and got identical results. |

