Independent cross-check (own on-chain scan, 2026-11-10). I read every EVK vault on Ethereum, Monad, Avalanche, Plasma, Sonic and Base: 2,103 vaults, 1,711 with a DefiLlama price. For each I read totalAssets, totalBorrows, cash, interestRate (per-second ray), interestFee and protocolFeeShare. The gross book is $572.1M supplied and $323.7M borrowed, which is within ~2% of DefiLlama's gross book at scan time ($253.8M net plus $329.5M borrowed = $583.3M; at ~16:00 UTC DefiLlama read $252.7M net plus $328.7M borrowed). I then split vaults by utilization:

