### Revenue and value capture

#### (a) Gross fees paid by users

Not available on-chain. Quant charges institutions licence/subscription and service fees in fiat. No public on-chain fee collector exists. DefiLlama, Token Terminal-style fee metrics: not tracked (no protocol listing).

